<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-AFRICAN NATIONS CUP GOALSCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN NATIONS CUP GOALSCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the qualifiers for the African Nations Cup finals in Burkina Faso next year:</p>
<p>5  Salaheddine Bassir (Morocco)</p>
<p>4  Joel Tiehi (Ivory Coast)</p>
<p>3  Jean-Jacques Misse Misse (Cameroon), Elias Juhar (Ethiopia), Pierre Aubame (Gabon), John Maduka (Malawi), Bassala Toure (Mali), Tico-Tico (Mozambique), Johannes Hindjou, Ruben van Wyk (Namibia), Bachirou Salou (Togo)</p>
</text>
